[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4445.43, "timestamp": "01:14:05", "text": "我为什么要那样做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4447.51, "timestamp": "01:14:07", "text": "管理得不错。 你觉得新"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4450.79, "timestamp": "01:14:10", "text": "地图怎么样？ 新地图不错。 我刚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4457.189, "timestamp": "01:14:17", "text": "进去，搜刮了一些东西，然后就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4465.03, "timestamp": "01:14:25", "text": "附近人很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4470.229, "timestamp": "01:14:30", "text": "跟我说话的那个人是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4473.27, "timestamp": "01:14:33", "text": "虽然他开枪打伤了我，但他人还不错"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4477.03, "timestamp": "01:14:37", "text": "。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4480.31, "timestamp": "01:14:40", "text": "那是一场误会。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4486.07, "timestamp": "01:14:46", "text": "兄弟。 我把这游戏的一切都忘光了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4488.87, "timestamp": "01:14:48", "text": "我花钱买这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4492.55, "timestamp": "01:14:52", "text": "短发造型只是为了得到它。 短发造型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4497.51, "timestamp": "01:14:57", "text": "这种发型。 嗯？ 所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4499.669, "timestamp": "01:14:59", "text": "你忘了？ 是的，我以前玩过这个"}]